    "detailed_description": "Dawn of Gray is a single-player visual novel with a distinctive style, in which you play the role of a young man discovering himself and his feelings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMore of a narrative essay than a video game, this project is a proposal for the more or less difficult experiences we can go through.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe 3 stories told will introduce you to a different character each time, with his or her own story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrailer music credit:<br />\r\nPillow Fort by Purrple Cat | https://purrplecat.com/",
